					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>However, when someone views <strong>SCP-096's face</strong>, whether it be directly, via video recording, or even a photograph, it will enter a stage of considerable emotional distress.</p> </blockquote> <p>This says nothing about other appendages or body parts of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-096">SCP-096</a>, so I think they'd be safe in this situation.</p> 
