					<![CDATA[
						 <p>To create a firm backlink, you use</p> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>[[[article-url|text to create backlink]]] or [[[Article Title]]] if the url and the title are the exact same excepting hyphens.</code> </pre></div> <p>So for the Zero Nine Six thing, you'd use</p> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>[[[scp-096|Zero Nine Six]]]</code> </pre></div> <p>or <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-096">Zero Nine Six</a>.</p> 
				 	]]>
